    ["ras-al-jinz", "Ras al Jinz", [40, 10, 15, 10], "nature offbeat", "Watch endangered green turtles haul themselves up the beach at night to lay their eggs on this wild Arabian Sea coast.", "Book the night turtle tour ahead; the hatching season is roughly July to October, when you may also see the babies run to the sea.", "Ras al Jinz"],
    ["wadi-bani-khalid", "Wadi Bani Khalid", [20, 10, 15, 2], "nature", "Turquoise pools between smooth boulders and palm trees, perfect for a swim and easy to reach from the main road.", "Come in the morning, before it fills with tour groups, and swim in modest clothing out of respect for local custom.", "Wadi Bani Khalid"],
    ["musandam", "Musandam", [35, 12, 10, 25], "nature offbeat beach", "Jagged mountains plunge into fjord-like inlets, with dolphins racing alongside traditional dhows and snorkelling in clear, calm water.", "A shared dhow day trip from Khasab includes lunch and snorkel gear, and it is far cheaper than a private boat.", "Musandam Governorate"],
    ["salalah", "Salalah", [30, 10, 12, 3], "nature beach offbeat", "Green monsoon hills in summer, frankincense trees, banana plantations and long white beaches in Oman's far south.", "Visit in the khareef season (July to September) for misty hills and waterfalls; hotels are cheaper outside it.", "Salalah"]
